title: "The Trust Percolation Bound: Correlated Trust Failure and the Structural Limits of Trust Governance"
abstract: "Simulation code, figures, LaTeX source, and reproducibility materials for a study of correlated trust failure in coordination networks. Proves an exact cascade-initiation floor and shows that, in the intermediate contagion regime, the cascade phase transition requires persistent local clustering. Includes ClinicalTrials.gov and AACT query materials for the clinical-trial empirical anchor."
